# Quisirella — Finance + Meta Ads

Doc khi phan tich co doanh thu Sheet hoac ghi `output/03-finance-summary.md`.

## Nguon du lieu

| Metric | Nguon chinh | File |
|---|---|---|
| Ad spend | **Meta API** | `data/meta_fetch/` |
| Doanh thu dat (thang) | **Sheet BÁO GIÁ 2026** cot M | `data/finance_fetch/bao_gia_2026_summary.json` |
| Loi nhuan dat (thang) | Sheet cot K | same |
| SL ban theo thang | Sheet cot H | same |
| Quang cao (Sheet) | Cot D YTD | Chi **tham chieu** — khong thay Meta spend |
| Tin nhan, funnel | Meta API | `data/meta_fetch/` |

Mapping cell: `config/finance_sheet.yaml`.

## Ky phan tich

- **Calendar month** — Meta `time_range` since/until khop `finance-fetcher --month YYYY-MM`
- Pre-2026: BÁO GIÁ 2026 chi co hang Thang 1–7/2026 — thang khac = `partial` hoac archive raw only

## Cong thuc (analyst ghi vao bang verbatim)

| Metric | Cong thuc |
|---|---|
| ROAS thuc | `doanh_thu_dat / meta_spend` (cung thang) |
| Chi phi/don | `meta_spend / qty_sold_month` (neu H > 0) |
| LTV:CAC proxy | `doanh_thu_dat / qty_sold / chi_phi_don` — tham chieu `unit_economics_budget_dm.md` |

**Khong** campaign-level ROAS — Sheet khong map campaign. Funnel Meta van per-campaign.

## Bang metrics mo rong (handoff)

| Period | Meta Spend | Tin nhan | Chi phi/tin nhan | Doanh thu Sheet | Loi nhuan Sheet | SL ban | ROAS thuc | Chi phi/don | Meta source | Sheet source |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

Sheet source: cite `bao_gia_2026_summary.json` + `source_cells` (vd. M8, K8).

## Caveats bat buoc

- Purchase Meta **khong** phan anh doanh thu that (chot DM)
- Quang cao tren Sheet **khong** phai spend chinh thuc cho ROAS
- SKU 1-cua-1 — doanh thu thang bien dong manh, khong so sanh nhu e-commerce volume

## Pipeline

1. `finance-fetcher`: `python -m quisirella fetch-finance --month YYYY-MM`
2. `meta-fetcher`: insights cung `date_range`
3. `meta-analyst`: bang tren + verdicts
4. `report-writer`: `03-finance-summary.md`
